Yes, you can absolutely edit the price of any license. Whether you want to adjust pricing based on demand, experiment with new strategies, or offer a temporary drop. You’re in full control. Here’s how it works: **How to Edit Your License Price**

1.  **Log into your Beat22 seller account**
2.  ****Click on Browse at the top****
    
    ![Click on Browse at the top](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210101.png)
    
3.  ****Click on “My Beats”****
    
    ![Click on “My Beats”](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-212015.png)
    
4.  ****Click on Edit option \[circled\]****
    
    ![Click on Edit option circled](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-07-01-003446.png)
    
5.  **Scroll to the License Section**
6.  **Update the price for any license (Non-Exclusive and Exclusive)**
7.  **Click “Submit”**

Your new prices will be reflected instantly on the marketplace.
